# Tasks

## Intro

This document contains a number of subtasks.

When finishing a subtask and BEFORE moving on the to the next subtask in here, ALWAYS do the following:
1. Build to check for errors.
2. Prefix the line in tasks.txt with "✅" 
3. git commit (use a txt file called commitmsg.txt for the message, overwrite if exists)
Do not do batch marking with ✅ or batch committing, do it between each. .
If told to do a megasession then fix/implement as many issues of the ones below as possible without user intervention. 
If necessary you may use AISpeak to ask the user for help/clarifications.
Only work on subtasks if told to do so or if told explicitly to do a Megasession. Did the user say megasession?


